  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d41811b9-b265-5043-9092-f08ee1d66c6e" activityNameId="7a3716e8-5e3c-573d-89d3-8ee938251d9f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Operation, biogas combustion, in micro gas turbine 100kWe</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Operation, biogas combustion, in micro gas turbine 100kWe
This dataset needs to be combined with the datasets for the biogas input and the infrastrucure expenditures in order to establish the multi-output process which provides the products electricity and heat from cogeneration.;
UUID: 3e3ad70e-9cf1-36fa-b5f1-aac0dd618c7f
Use of biogas in a gas turbine. Included are emissions to air, as well as use and disposal of operational supplements. Excluded are the biogas consumption and infrastructure expenditures.
Location: Biogas input modelled for conditions in Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3e3ad70e-9cf1-36fa-b5f1-aac0dd618c7f.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
